The Qwen K4/V4 cache codec adapts the published variance-normalized numeric
method and tiled representation to a fixed Qwen Flash-Next geometry. The
implementation stores K/V code payloads token-major, removes vLLM allocator
padding, reconstructs only selected physical rows, and writes BF16 outputs. No
vLLM allocator or serving code is included.
